    "body": "Yesterday I created a personal module of a toggle term, then I thought of sharing it somewhere, then I remembered this wonderful plugin, I hope it will be useful to you, I would like you to try this little piece of code. if you don't agree reject the pr :)\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2022-05-04T15:43:22Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for this contribution! This does look interesting.\r\nAt the moment I plan to create 'mini.terminals' that would be similar to [kassio/neoterm](https://github.com/kassio/neoterm): coherently manage terminal windows and send text from buffers to terminal windows and vice versa. I use this kind of functionality all the time, so I would like 'mini.terminals' to be implemented with it. Admittedly, it is not a next planned module (not even nearest three, I think), but I plan to eventually implement it.\r\n\r\nNevertheless, thanks again for your PR!",
            "created_at": "2022-05-04T15:43:22Z",
